	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Accepi per <persName>Iacaudum</persName> nostrum literas tuas, colendissine domine <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>compater, una cum sermonum tuorum exemplaribus.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Et quod <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>quidem in translatione ista quędam circa plagium mutasti, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>recte et prudenter atque iure fecisti tuo, et ago tibi gratias.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Ego in hoc opere tuo eximio et sancto vertendo lente admodum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>propter quotidiana negotia procedo, quamvis in ultimam usque progr<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>essus sim decadem.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Sin aliquis ex hoc labore fructus ad <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>ecclesiam redire possit, bene, est quod domino gratias agam; sin <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>minus, tamen mihi magno et oblectamento et emolumento <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>fuit hoc exercitium, et hoc ero contentus.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quod res no<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>vas attinet, nihil habeo, quod his addam quae paucos ante <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>dies ad te scripsi.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Scribit <persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName> quem non dubito communicare <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>tibi ea quę a <persName>Mecardo</persName> accepit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Is inter alia suis ad <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>d. <persName ref="p8417">Musculum</persName> literis haec inserit: Deinde peto iudicium tuum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>de concordia atque consensione d. <persName ref="p540">Calvini</persName> et <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>i <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>in negotio eucharistię, quam quidam maxime urgent, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>quasi medium quiddam sit inter Lutheranos et <persName>Zvinglianos</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>omnibusque ecclesiis acceptabile.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Et ad hanc generosus et doctus <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ille baro <persName ref="p8041">Iohannes a Lasco</persName> etc., qui nunc in <placeName ref="l825">Dania</placeName> agit, suo <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>scripto illustrissimum electorem <persName>Palatinum</persName> hortatur et caeteras omnes <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>ecclesias, ut in eo tandem omnes contra Antichristum conveniant.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Dominus clementia sua faxit ut in eo omnes conveniamus.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Haec ille.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Reliqua dabit <persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName>.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">De obitu pontificis <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>certa ex te cognoscere cupimus; fertur enim obiisse illum.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Ex <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> quoque nos praeter tristia nihil audimus, quamvis <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>sint, qui affirment in <placeName ref="l2665">Hybernia</placeName> constanter praedicari <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>evangelium neque quicquam illic a regina potuisse mutari.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Sine dubio exitialis <placeName ref="l830">Anglię</placeName> clades imminet, cui dominus <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>tam claram veritatis praedicationem praeire voluit.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Utinam <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>nos quoque tempus visitationis agnoscamus et venturę ire dignis <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>poenitentiae fructibus occurramus.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Nostri te omnes salutant.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Cupio quoque salutem ex me dici d. <persName ref="p8011">Gvalthero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z33"/><persName ref="p8127">Pellicano</persName> et reliquis dominis et fratribus colendissimis.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8011">Gval[thero]</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>item dicas, oro, filium <persName ref="p8519">Ioannis Wunderlich</persName> i[n domo] <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>d. <persName ref="p7879">Wittenbachii</persName> quartana detineri febri et hanc [ess<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>e] rationem, cur illum mittere ad eum differant, ne forte <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>miretur, cur id fiat, aut me lusisse cum illo existimet, <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>qui, ut reciperet eum, ab illo impetravi.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Quamprimum <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>melius habere coeperit, veniet.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Vale cum tuis omnibus, <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>quos meo meorumque nomine salutabis.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> 10. ianuarii <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>1554.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z42"/>Tuus ex animo <persName ref="p8018">Ioannes <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>Hallerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesię pastori fidelissimo, domino <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ac compatri suo honorando.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="de">M. <persName ref="p495">Heinrych <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>Bullinger</persName>n.</s>
				</p>
